    "The Dao's first setGenesisAddresses call routed UTILS to this Utils; later calls rewrote the same address, Sparta's changeDAO to this Dao came 21 blocks earlier, and the four victim pools were deployed after it but carry no defect of their own.",
    "Gross depletion of the four pools over the 19 txs, from loss.mjs. SPARTA, which the attacker sold back into the pools over three days, is valued at what those 59 sales realised (844.5 BNB plus BTCB, ETH, BUSD, USDT), not its pre-crash quote. Copycats were found from the pools' RemoveLiquidity events through block 7119999."
